#! ia 1.0

@operation render-captured-template
  meaning
    says "Render one structured-v1 @template from its captured JSON resource into bounded draft bytes and an evidence digest through the native-template-tools harness; nothing is written."
    answers "Which governed operation renders a structured-v1 @template from its captured JSON resource into draft bytes and an evidence digest without writing a file?"
  execution
    handler captured-template-render
    effects draft-only
    input captured-template-input
    output draft-result
    profile governed-v1
    recovery repeatable
